  },
  {
    "id": 4001050010060,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "最近ちょい忙しくってさ",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105001/4001050010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "愛依の弟",
    "text": "けど、夏休みは遊べるんだろ！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "愛依の弟",
    "text": "旅行もあるし、夏祭りも行って\r\nあと花火大会とか……プールも行かないと！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050010070,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "おっ、いいね～\r\n学校休みになるし、時間はできると思うわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105001/4001050010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050010080,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "予定立てよ～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105001/4001050010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "愛依の弟",
    "text": "おっしゃー！\r\nじゃ、じゃあさ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "愛依の弟",
    "text": "もしも、いいよって言われたら、\r\nあさひねーちゃんと、その……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "愛依の弟",
    "text": "……ふ、ふゆねーちゃんも一緒に…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050010090,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "え～！？　何なに\r\nうちじゃなくて冬優子ちゃんと遊びたい系！？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
